From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: po: the Screensavers link of Display & Monitor in the edition's nine other languages

The edition's translations of the strings kscreen-screensavers-link.patch adds
(queue row 96), on the 6.7.4 catalogues as the edition has patched them so far.
A first draft made with AI assistance, pending native speakers; KDE's
translation teams take the strings later.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.2
---
diff --git a/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po b/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po
--- a/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po
+++ b/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po
@@ -1483,3 +1483,8 @@
 msgid "3D is not active for this screen."
 msgstr "Tryb 3D nie jest aktywny na tym ekranie."
 
+#: kcm/ui/main.qml
+#, kde-format
+msgctxt "@action:button opens the Screensavers settings page"
+msgid "Screensavers…"
+msgstr "Wygaszacze ekranu…"
